Components in this repository that are Rune DSL (Apache-2.0) material
---------------------------------------------------------------------

1. rune-runtime/src/main/java - the released 9.83.0 runtime sources
   (org.finos.rune:rune-runtime:9.83.0, sources jar): 146 files, of which 131 are
   taken verbatim with their Apache copyright headers, 14 are modified and 1 is
   added, the last two groups listed under "Modified files" below. The reasons for
   each change are in docs/upgrades/U018-fork-owned-runtime.md,
   U020-lazy-failure-text-runtime.md, U021-deferred-mapper-path-lineage.md and
   U022-seed-deferred-mapper-path-construction.md.
2. rune-runtime/src/main/resources/model/basictypes.rosetta and annotations.rosetta,
   and the same two files at demo/corpus/builtins/ - the upstream builtin models,
   verbatim.
3. rune-java-generator/src/test/java/com/regnosys/rosetta/generator/java/Upstream*PortTest.java
   and their harness - test cases ported from the upstream integration tests
   (rune-integration-tests) to this implementation's API; each class names the
   upstream test it ports.
4. Small model fixtures and expected outputs derived from upstream examples and from
   the public CDM model where a file says so (test-corpus/chaos and the held-out
   fixtures carry their own provenance notes).

